"""CMAQ v4.6 free-molecular correction factors for modal coagulation.

Data, not code: the tables ``bm0``, ``bm0ij`` and ``bm3i`` of CMAQ's
``getcoags`` (F. S. Binkowski, 2003), as carried in E3SM's
``modal_aero_coag.F90`` (BSD-3), transcribed 2026-10-01 by parsing that
file's ``DATA`` statements. They correct Whitby et al. (1991)'s analytic
free-molecular moment integrals toward the Gauss-Hermite quadratures of
Binkowski and Roselle (2003). ``bm0`` is indexed by the σ_g class of one
mode; ``bm0ij``/``bm3i`` by (diameter-ratio class, σ_g class of the
smaller mode, σ_g class of the larger mode), all zero-based here where
the Fortran is one-based. See :mod:`.coagulation` for the index rules.
"""

